> Check the guidance interpolation endpoints

Classifier-free guidance computes epsilon_null+w*(epsilon_class-epsilon_null). With null prediction .2 and conditional prediction .8, strengths 0,1,2 give .2,.8,1.4. Strength above one extrapolates; this arithmetic alone does not establish sample quality.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/diffusion_guidance_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <iostream>
namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;using T=n::Tensor;
int main(){std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
std::vector<T> out;for(int k=0;k<3;++k)out.push_back(m::ClassifierFreeEpsilon(n::full({1,2},.8),n::full({1,2},.2),n::scalar(k)));T left=n::from_vector(std::vector<float>{0,1,2},{3}),right=n::select(n::concat(out,0),1,0),extra=n::full({3},.8);
 auto av=left.to_vector<double>(),bv=right.to_vector<double>(),cv=extra.to_vector<double>();
 std::cout<<"| Strength | Mixed epsilon | Conditional epsilon |\n|---:|---:|---:|\n";
 for(std::size_t i=0;i<av.size();++i)std::cout<<"|"<<av[i]<<"|"<<bv[i]<<"|"<<cv[i]<<"|\n";
 n::save_npz("build/diffusion_guidance_worked.npz",{{"a",left},{"b",right},{"c",extra}});
 dm::graphics::RPlot::create().points(n::arange(0,std::int64_t(bv.size())).to_vector<double>(),bv,"Native worked values",{37,99,235},4).x_label("Coordinate / probe index").y_label("Native computed value").title("Check the guidance interpolation endpoints").size(900,500).save_svg("build/diffusion_guidance_worked.svg");
}
```
