> Trace the separate noisy-image classifier

The classifier consumes72 encoded state/time features and returns10 logits, with3722 values in six leaves. Target labels never enter its predictor input.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/diffusion_guidance_classifier_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace n=dm::nn;namespace m=n::models;n::ParameterStore p(14003);m::CreateGuidance(p,true);n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& encoded){auto o=m::DiffusionMlp(p,encoded);n::model_stage("Hidden1:32 SiLU",encoded,o.hidden1);n::model_stage("Hidden2:32 SiLU",o.hidden1,o.hidden2);return n::model_stage("Ten class logits",o.hidden2,o.value);},"Noisy classifier:3722 values / six leaves");n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;auto graph=model.plot(n::zeros({1,72}),options);if(graph.parameter_count()!=3722)throw std::runtime_error("Classifier executed census");graph.save_svg("build/diffusion_guidance_classifier_network.svg");}
```
// result_begin: markdown
\image(figures/diffusion_guidance_classifier_network.svg)
// result_end
